    "t1-summarize-alice": "**Summary of your thread with Alice**\n\n- **Goal**: You and Alice are collaborating on reviewing the quarterly plan.  \n- **Key messages**:\n  1. **Alice** (2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:12) asked you to review the plan before Friday.  \n  2. **You** (2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:20) agreed, offering to look at the draft that day.  \n  3. **Alice** (2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:31) sent the draft (attachment `att\u20111`), noting that the hiring section still needs work.\n\nThe conversation is a brief exchange of a plan review request, your commitment to review, and Alice\u2019s update with the draft. No further action is noted in this thread.",
